          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ganita Prakash | Grade 6"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.12,
            0.885,
            0.164
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Adding fractions with the same fractional unit or denominator",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.179,
            0.533,
            0.207
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Example",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": ": Find the sum of "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac{2}{5}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " and "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac{1}{5}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.226,
            0.885,
            0.294
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Let us represent both using the rectangular strips. In both fractions, the fractional unit is the same "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac{1}{5}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " , so, each strip will be divided into 5 equal parts."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.305,
            0.485,
            0.333
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "So "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac{2}{5}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " will be represented as —"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.314,
            0.341,
            0.602,
            0.381
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 5,
              "bbox": [
                0.314,
                0.341,
                0.602,
                0.381
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_25_image_5.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.399,
            0.504,
            0.426
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "And "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 1 } { 5 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " will be represented as —"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.314,
            0.431,
            0.601,
            0.47
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 7,
              "bbox": [
                0.314,
                0.431,
                0.601,
                0.47
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_25_image_7.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.477,
            0.884,
            0.546
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Adding the two given fractions is the same as finding out the total number of shaded parts, each of which represent the same fractional unit "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 1 } { 5 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.553,
            0.885,
            0.625
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "In this case, the total number of shaded parts is 3. Since, each shaded part represents the fractional unit "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac{1}{5}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " , we see that the 3 shaded parts together represent the fraction "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac{3}{5}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.646,
            0.394,
            0.675
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Therefore, "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac{2}{5} + \\frac{1}{5} = \\frac{3}{5} ?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.423,
            0.635,
            0.71,
            0.675
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 11,
              "bbox": [
                0.423,
                0.635,
                0.71,
                0.675
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_25_image_11.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.165,
            0.69,
            0.552,
            0.718
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Example",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": ": Find the sum of "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 4 } { 7 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " and "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "{ \\frac { 6 } { 7 } } ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.722,
            0.884,
            0.792
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Let us represent both again using the rectangular strip model. Here in both fractions, the fractional unit is the same, i.e., "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 1 } { 7 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " , so each strip will be divided into 7 equal parts."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.195,
            0.795,
            0.537,
            0.82
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Then "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 4 } { 7 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " will be represented as —"
            }
          ]
        },
